{"seq":1,"slug":"video-understanding","title":"视频理解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/video-and-3d/video-understanding","wordCount":1492,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"视频理解\">视频理解</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>视频理解的目标是让计算机理解视频中发生了什么、在哪里发生、何时发生。与图像理解的静态分析不同，视频理解需要建模时间维度的动态变化——运动模式、事件顺序和时序因果关系。视频理解涵盖视频分类、时序动作检测、视频描述和视频问答等多种任务。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[视频] --&gt; B[帧采样策略]&#10;    B --&gt; C[视觉编码器]&#10;    C --&gt; D{时序建模}&#10;    D --&gt; E[3D 卷积]&#10;    D --&gt; F[时序 Transformer]&#10;    D --&gt; G[RNN/LSTM]&#10;    E --&gt; H[视频表示]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[任务头]\">graph LR\n    A[视频] --&gt; B[帧采样策略]\n    B --&gt; C[视觉编码器]\n    C --&gt; D{时序建模}\n    D --&gt; E[3D 卷积]\n    D --&gt; F[时序 Transformer]\n    D --&gt; G[RNN/LSTM]\n    E --&gt; H[视频表示]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[任务头]</pre><p>视频的数据规模远大于图像——一段 10 秒 30fps 的视频包含 300 帧图像，直接处理所有帧的计算成本极高。因此，帧采样策略是视频理解的第一个关键决策：均匀采样、关键帧选择还是密集采样直接影响模型能够捕获的时序信息。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法类型</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n<th>时序建模</th>\n<th>Kinetics-400 Top-1</th>\n<th>计算量</th>\n<th>输入帧数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2D CNN + 聚合</td>\n<td>TSN</td>\n<td>段级平均</td>\n<td>70.6</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>8-16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3D CNN</td>\n<td>I3D, SlowFast</td>\n<td>3D 卷积</td>\n<td>77.0/79.8</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>32-64</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Video Transformer</td>\n<td>TimeSformer, ViViT</td>\n<td>时空注意力</td>\n<td>80.7</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>8-32</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高效 Transformer</td>\n<td>VideoMAE v2</td>\n<td>掩码建模</td>\n<td>86.6</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>16</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"3d-卷积与时空特征\">3D 卷积与时空特征</h2><p>3D 卷积将 2D 卷积扩展到时间维度，卷积核同时在空间和时间方向滑动，能够捕获视频中的运动模式。I3D（Inflated 3D）通过将 ImageNet 预训练的 2D 卷积核&quot;膨胀&quot;为 3D 来初始化网络，有效地将图像预训练知识迁移到视频任务。</p>\n<p>SlowFast 网络采用双流设计：Slow 路径以低帧率（如 4fps）处理视频，捕获空间语义信息；Fast 路径以高帧率（如 32fps）处理视频，捕获细粒度的运动信息。两条路径通过横向连接融合信息，在保持计算效率的同时实现了出色的时序建模。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class C3DBlock(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels, out_channels):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.conv = nn.Conv3d(in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size=(3, 3, 3), padding=(1, 1, 1))&#10;        self.bn = nn.BatchNorm3d(out_channels)&#10;        self.relu = nn.ReLU()&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        return self.relu(self.bn(self.conv(x)))&#10;&#10;class SlowFastBlock(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, slow_channels, fast_channels):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.slow_path = C3DBlock(slow_channels, slow_channels)&#10;        self.fast_path = C3DBlock(fast_channels, fast_channels)&#10;        self.lateral = nn.Conv3d(fast_channels, slow_channels // 4, kernel_size=(5, 1, 1), stride=(4, 1, 1), padding=(2, 0, 0))&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, slow, fast):&#10;        fast_out = self.fast_path(fast)&#10;        lateral = self.lateral(fast_out)&#10;        slow_in = torch.cat([slow, lateral], dim=1)&#10;        slow_out = self.slow_path(slow_in)&#10;        return slow_out, fast_out\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> C3DBlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_channels, out_channels):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv3d(in_channels, out_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kernel_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.BatchNorm3d(out_channels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.relu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.ReLU()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.relu(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv(x)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SlowFastBlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, slow_channels, fast_channels):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.slow_path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> C3DBlock(slow_channels, slow_channels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fast_path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> C3DBlock(fast_channels, fast_channels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lateral </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv3d(fast_channels, slow_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kernel_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, slow, fast):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fast_out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fast_path(fast)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        lateral </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lateral(fast_out)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        slow_in </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cat([slow, lateral], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        slow_out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.slow_path(slow_in)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow_out, fast_out</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph SlowFast 网络&#10;        A[视频输入] --&gt; B[Slow 路径 4fps]&#10;        A --&gt; C[Fast 路径 32fps]&#10;        C --&gt; D[横向连接]&#10;        D --&gt; B&#10;        B --&gt; E[Slow 特征]&#10;        C --&gt; F[Fast 特征]&#10;        E --&gt; G[融合+分类]&#10;        F --&gt; G&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph SlowFast 网络\n        A[视频输入] --&gt; B[Slow 路径 4fps]\n        A --&gt; C[Fast 路径 32fps]\n        C --&gt; D[横向连接]\n        D --&gt; B\n        B --&gt; E[Slow 特征]\n        C --&gt; F[Fast 特征]\n        E --&gt; G[融合+分类]\n        F --&gt; G\n    end</pre><p>R(2+1)D 将 3D 卷积分解为空间 2D 卷积和时间 1D 卷积的组合，减少了参数量同时增加了非线性变换次数，在相同计算量下取得了更好的效果。X3D 通过网络架构搜索在多个维度（时间、空间、宽度、深度）上同时缩放，找到了不同计算预算下的最优视频网络。</p>\n<h2 id=\"视频-transformer\">视频 Transformer</h2><p>视频 Transformer 将 ViT 的自注意力机制扩展到时空域，通过建模帧内像素间和帧间 patch 间的长程依赖来理解视频内容。TimeSformer 探索了五种时空注意力变体，发现&quot;分离注意力&quot;（先空间注意力再时间注意力）在效率和效果之间取得了最佳平衡。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class DividedSpaceTimeAttention(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, dim, num_heads, num_frames):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.spatial_attn = nn.MultiheadAttention(dim, num_heads, batch_first=True)&#10;        self.temporal_attn = nn.MultiheadAttention(dim, num_heads, batch_first=True)&#10;        self.num_frames = num_frames&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x, num_patches):&#10;        b = x.shape[0]&#10;&#10;        x_spatial = x.view(b * self.num_frames, num_patches, -1)&#10;        x_spatial, _ = self.spatial_attn(x_spatial, x_spatial, x_spatial)&#10;        x = x_spatial.view(b, self.num_frames * num_patches, -1)&#10;&#10;        x_temporal = x.view(b * num_patches, self.num_frames, -1)&#10;        x_temporal, _ = self.temporal_attn(x_temporal, x_temporal, x_temporal)&#10;        x = x_temporal.view(b, self.num_frames * num_patches, -1)&#10;&#10;        return x\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B